# forgotten/epilogue_vigil_say.mcfunction
# Runs only as the authoritative Vigil witness.

data modify storage sf:temp vline set value "The readings just... opened. Like a held breath. He's not on any instrument I have. He's not GONE, he's just — not contained. Not anywhere I can point to."
function sf:quest/vance

data modify storage sf:temp vline set value "I felt him, for a second. My grandfather. The real one. ...What did we just do? What did you just let out? I don't know. But thank you. I think. I think thank you."
function sf:quest/vance